{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the digits in base ten of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6009a64aac0fa8289dd5933518b4716cdc753204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10^{4n^2+8}+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"23\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer, is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce761745d76b95fd73d1fab6c6c5b2413eaf230.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4n \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2+2n \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4n^2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ n^2+n+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"494\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that the result of this expression will always be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af95b4e72ec4d09b6fa02cc4546129a00c528fe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(100\\text{ some number of zeros }001)^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"21\" /> Multiplying these together yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d5c619fae9d43d5d3ac869d08832df3644c2c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[110\\text{ some number of zeros }011.\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"13\" /> This works because of the way they are multiplied. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/2/b226aa19ebf1b28c340ad1a3d34cd31e9506ae25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(A) 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"48\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <